        "[DOC_ID:local-ollama] Local Ollama condition  \nA local model condition needs an exact installed model name, digest, quantization, Ollama version, and hardware record. A deployment smoke proves availability only; it does not establish equivalence to a hosted quality test.",
        "[DOC_ID:wire-capture] Proxy evidence  \nCapture redacted provider request and response bodies, actual reported input, output, and cached tokens, completion latency, and all budget mutations. For nonstreaming task calls, mark time to first token unavailable rather than relabeling response time.",
        "[DOC_ID:context-compaction] Native context compaction  \nNative context compaction defaults to disabled. Its default threshold is 80000 tokens and retention defaults to 40 percent. Tests must enable it on a saved chat and lower the threshold enough to prove a summary was generated."
